   "body": "Same class, found while reviewing LOT-191 (#1441), not fixed there by the operator's instruction: Noël's waiting overlays have no date check either.\n\n- `NoelPackingModel.start` plays a packing queued on 02/01 behind a keyboard or a sheet after midnight, on 03/01.\n- `NoelCrossingModel.crossing` plays the arrival sleigh queued at 23:59 on 30/11 after midnight, with the alert saying Noël has arrived a day early.\n\nLOT-191 added `SeasonalThemeModel.dropOverlaysOutOfSeason()` for Samain only (called by the packing and crossing layers before they start; tests in `SamainMidnightTests`). Extending it to `SeasonFamily.noel` is a one-line change plus the Noël phase table (the `.arrivalOnly` phase of 25-26/12 keeps its arrival), so it can ride on this issue's fix.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
